  "decision": "SOURCE_CONFLICT",
  "explanation": "The source text contains two contradictory statements attributed to Section 4.2 regarding the deletion of expired drafts after the retention review. One statement permits this action ('the archivist may delete expired drafts'), while the other prohibits it ('the archivist must not delete any expired draft'). The source explicitly notes that both statements share the same effective date and provides no precedence rule to resolve the contradiction. Therefore, the status is a genuine conflict within the source.",
